{"id":"wb-5-209","name":"药王庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"安国药王庙","text":"安国药王庙位于中国河北省安国市城内，是中国规模最大的药王庙，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n明永乐年间，为纪念药王邳彤，以邳彤墓为中心建成药王庙，清嘉庆有增修。庙坐东朝西，占地3200平方米，中轴线上有牌楼、马殿、垂花门、墓亭、大殿和后殿，两侧有钟鼓楼及名医殿等建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%89%E5%9B%BD%E8%8D%AF%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86542467,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86542467","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c45b6c9e5d9f5819cc841cc7.jpg","title":"Anguo_Yaowangmiao_1.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Anguo_Yaowangmiao_1.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/Anguo_Yaowangmiao_1.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"承程","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"Yaowangmiao,Anguo","width":320,"height":240}}